    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Clashing over exchanged insults that compromise their reputations, a woman running from her sordid past and a doctor&apos;s wife who depends on tenant income risk everything to protect shattering secrets.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Dawn revels in her getaways with her perfect husband, the occasional long weekend in luxurious homes, temporarily inhabiting other people&apos;s privileged lives. Miranda is a doctor&apos;s wife but she needs the house rental money from Dawn-- desperately. People don&apos;t know what&apos;s really going on, about her son. When Dawn writes an intense, negative review, Marina won&apos;t take this threat to her livelihood lying down. Neither can yield, not before they&apos;ve dredged up all that&apos;s hidden-- even if it has the power to shatter all they&apos;ve built.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
